
<CENTER>

<SPAN CLASS="title2">Searching for and selecting payables</SPAN>


<table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="5">
  <tr>
    <td valign="top">
      <p align="right" style="margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 4"><FONT color="#008000"><B>Searching
      for &quot;all&quot;:</B></FONT></td>
    <td valign="top">
      <p align="left" style="margin-bottom: 4">By
      leaving all of the search criteria on the default settings and clicking
      &quot;Search&quot;, you will receive all of the listings in our data
      base.&nbsp; A note of caution -- the data base is very large and the
      number of records you will be receive may span several pages of
      results.&nbsp; It is best to search against one or more of the criteria
      provided.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td valign="top">
      <p align="right" style="margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 4"><FONT color="#008000"><B>Using
      search strings:</B></FONT></td>
    <td valign="top">The
      empty boxes to the left of several of the search criteria are used for
      searching based on a string of characters.&nbsp; The search is not case
      sensitive and will return any result that contains your string.&nbsp; For
      example, if you were searching for Donald's BBQ House and entered &quot;Donald's&quot;
      in the box, you would receive all of the McDonald's records as
      well.
      <p>When searching for Payables, search
      strings can be used against the payable number, billback number, billback
      age in days, or the <cfoutput>#application.returned_customer_setting.distributor_label_singular#</cfoutput>, broker, and/or <cfoutput>#application.returned_customer_setting.operator_label_singular#</cfoutput> name associated
      with the payable you are looking for.&nbsp;</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td valign="top">
      <p align="right" style="margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 4"><FONT color="#008000"><B>Dates
      Ranges:</B></FONT></td>
    <td valign="top">When searching for
      Payables, you may be interested in viewing those associated with the
      billback and/or payment dates.&nbsp; To receive a result such as that,
      enter a range of dates for the period you are interested in for either or
      both of these two variables.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td valign="top">
      <p align="right" style="margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 4"><FONT color="#008000"><B>Results
      and selection:</B></FONT></td>
    <td valign="top">Select
      the payable you wish to view or edit by clicking on the Payable Number
      in the far left column of the search results.&nbsp; Note that your search
      may have returned more than one page of results and you may need to
      navigate across several pages to find the payable you are looking for.</td>
  </tr>
</table>



</CENTER>

